  Lemma dp_tab : ltac2:(zQ "h60!igd!il4!h9!hsf!ht6!js4!hj2!t8!hva!ira!lpe!jnd!lq8!kkc!kh5!kod!ls4!ihf!ig1!lne!lsa!kk5>1b$2>0@2$8@2$h2Z^1@2$h3^1@2$h5+2+h4@4$e$9@4$b@2$1@1$0#k0?3sp0@2$1@1$0#k0?4brk0@2$3@1$4?1h?1E?4FULL@2$h1+ipvgl8@2$h4+4^2@3$6$5@1$d@1$f@3$h0$2Z@2$a@2$c@2$1@1$0#k0?3sp0@2$3@1$4?1h?1E^2@1$7$5").
Proof.
  (* rc.2: depot.py's rehash puts t1's bucket (6030) below t0's (174656); the cases follow that order. *)
  intros b Hb. change (Z.pow 2 20) with 1048576 in Hb.
  pose proof dp_tab_zero4 as Z4. pose proof dp_tab_slots as [S0 S1].
  unfold depot0, pm_trace_hash; cbn [AsDepotInv.d_chain].
  destruct (AsMainSyms.pm_short (bv_unsigned sp0)) eqn:PS; cbv beta iota in S0, S1.
  - replace (AsDepotInv.bucket 0x1dffda361272aa40) with 174656 by (vm_compute; reflexivity).
    destruct (Z.eqb_spec b 174656) as [->|N0]; cbn [hd].
    + replace (0x29f058 + 4 * 174656) with 0x349958 by lia. exact S0.
    + destruct (Z.eqb_spec b 6030) as [->|N1].
      * replace (0x29f058 + 4 * 6030) with 0x2a4e90 by lia. exact S1.
      * apply Z4. lia.
  - replace (AsDepotInv.bucket 0xc527414aad30178e) with 6030 by (vm_compute; reflexivity).
    destruct (Z.eqb_spec b 6030) as [->|N1]; cbn [hd].
    + replace (0x29f058 + 4 * 6030) with 0x2a4e90 by lia. exact S1.
    + destruct (Z.eqb_spec b 174656) as [->|N0].
      * replace (0x29f058 + 4 * 174656) with 0x349958 by lia. exact S0.
      * apply Z4. lia.
Qed.

